{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/6933fa70c7150c178999441529afc8fc.avif?t=1770919959\" width=620 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succubus: The Lustborn Curse is an 18+ 2.5D action Metroidvania where you play as Myrritha, a fallen succubus cursed after a failed attempt to seduce a priest. Stripped of her powers, she awakens in a realm of lust-driven monsters, cursed ruins, and forbidden sanctuaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>dark anime-inspired world</strong> dripping with corruption, from dungeon depths to haunted swamps and twisted cathedrals. The mature narrative of mystery, sin, and revenge unfolds through dialogue, encounters, and explicit cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/d8f94de5b761b0bfffd3515792e2a0fb.poster.avif?t=1770919959\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/d8f94de5b761b0bfffd3515792e2a0fb.webm?t=1770919959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/75912a87048d3c4dcfe33ed4c2dfeee3.avif?t=1770919959\" width=750 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/2ac622a3f0827bf938d603b4c4742707.avif?t=1770919959\" width=620 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fast, fluid, and erotic. Wield dual blades, unleash dark magic, and finish foes with devastating moves. Enemies and bosses alike push you to master both <strong>skillful hack-and-slash combat</strong> and clever use of your succubus powers.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack-and-Slash Battles</strong> \u2013 Responsive melee and ranged combat with evolving combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/8838fb64f33b13b4e7e0ec5b7e227f3e.poster.avif?t=1770919959\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/8838fb64f33b13b4e7e0ec5b7e227f3e.webm?t=1770919959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Deadly Bossesand monstrous foes with unique styles test your reflexes and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metroidvania Exploration</strong> \u2013 Unlock shortcuts, abilities, and secrets across interconnected zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runes, Abilities &amp; Weapons </strong>- Customize your playstyle by mixing runes, abilities, and weapons. Go fast-paced, defensive, or lean fully into lewd-focused builds, the choice is yours!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/0dc4caaa6d89c165e17d9f2373a72258.poster.avif?t=1770919959\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/0dc4caaa6d89c165e17d9f2373a72258.webm?t=1770919959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/75912a87048d3c4dcfe33ed4c2dfeee3.avif?t=1770919959\" width=750 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/ec657e5beeac59b8962a7f36f96d72dc.avif?t=1770919959\" width=620 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, lust isn\u2019t optional, it\u2019s essential. Erotic encounters fuel your progression, restore energy, and unlock new powers.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seduction Finishers</strong> \u2013 Lewd animations drain enemies and restore HP/MP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/81df6ebe676fa06667a778ef295ab897.poster.avif?t=1770919959\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/81df6ebe676fa06667a778ef295ab897.webm?t=1770919959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lewd Abilities</strong> \u2013 Lust becomes a combat mechanic, not just fanservice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacrificial Altars</strong> \u2013 Perform orgiastic rituals with captured enemies to gain buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/67d1fc74bedaccc7fe98cf005084d972.poster.avif?t=1770919959\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/67d1fc74bedaccc7fe98cf005084d972.webm?t=1770919959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncensored Adult Content</strong> \u2013 Fully animated NSFW encounters, finishers, and cutscenes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that\u2019s only the beginning, Succubus: The Lustborn Curse is packed with even more lewd mechanics to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dark &amp; Sinful Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a twisted world of lust and corruption, where forbidden magic and seductive power collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds as you explore, seduce, and conquer - with dialogue, encounters, and lewd cutscenes that reveal more of the succubus\u2019s curse and the dark forces behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect a mature narrative filled with mystery, sin, and revenge, woven seamlessly into both the combat and erotic progression</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Metroidvania Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse an interconnected world of cursed ruins, dripping swamps, and corrupted cathedrals. Discover secrets, unlock shortcuts, and return to previous zones with new abilities to uncover everything the realm hides.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World of Sin and Power Awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Succubus: The Lustborn Curse</i> combines satisfying action with richly animated adult content in a mature, story-driven world of darkness and desire. Whether you're drawn to the combat, the corruption, or the kink, this journey offers something wickedly unforgettable.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chains Broken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651160/dcdec87399c5a9513dfdd836298ad42bc99d9bec.jpg"},{"name":"Blasphemous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651160/bdbd0e978846df00f8cfed61e15cf034d5b4eccd.jpg"},{"name":"Insatiable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651160/1815466cada66d35e4fca71e1a489159c555da35.jpg"},{"name":"Queen of Corruption","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651160/8e3489e3d9918a01c727686dc983028788813f7e.jpg"},{"name":"Wardrobe of Sin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651160/c0505d13a0329a764064f19749087da2f4dbab4f.jpg"},{"name":"Favorite Customer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651160/2ec89cb6cebac98058985e301c6fcf7a15f19e50.jpg"},{"name":"The Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651160/9528b9e1b150861f502d36460d29755d3d124e22.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651160?t=1770919959","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/19503d1a339ef65fbc81520ffd6f8f024b83eabb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770919959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/fa1f7b5250ea1dd8a7fab5626fc180a906298320/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770919959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/fa1f7b5250ea1dd8a7fab5626fc180a906298320/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770919959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains explicit sexual content presented in a stylized dark fantasy setting, including full nudity (male, female, humanoid, and fantasy creatures), animated sexual encounters with fantasy and mythological creatures, and lewd combat abilities focused on seduction, domination, essence-draining, and fictional non-consensual fantasy themes.\r\n\r\nAdditional content includes magical seduction and enchantment, BDSM-themed fantasy scenarios involving restraints and domination, ritual scenes involving group sexual activity, exhibitionism, and other non-vanilla sexual acts.\r\n\r\nSupernatural elements such as aphrodisiacs, charms, and lust-inducing magic are central to gameplay and narrative. Certain environmental traversal mechanics involve fantasy creatures temporarily engulfing the protagonist in a non-violent, non-realistic manner.\r\n\r\nAll characters are depicted as adults over the age of 20.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of real-world sexual assault, rape, drug abuse, or self-harm.\r\n\r\nAll scenarios are fictional, highly stylized, and intended for mature audiences only. Some content may be disturbing. Viewer discretion is strongly advised."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3849840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651160/extras/6933fa70c7150c178999441529afc8fc.avif?t=1770919959\" width=620 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succubus: The Lustborn Curse is an 18+ 2.5D action Metroidvania where you play as Myrritha, a fallen succubus cursed after a failed attempt to seduce a priest. Stripped of her powers, she awakens in a realm of lust-driven monsters, cursed ruins, and forbidden sanctuaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>dark anime-inspired world</strong> dripping with corru